[{:db/id "answer-field-e0acaaa5-2cd5-585e-9e7b-5ecd5fab47c9" :answer-field/id #uuid "e0acaaa5-2cd5-585e-9e7b-5ecd5fab47c9" :answer-field/correct 17592186670573 :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices [17592186670572 17592186670574 17592186670575 17592186670573 17592186670571] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id 17592186670576 :question/worked-solution "If $X\\sim\\operatorname{Po}(\\lambda)$, then its probability mass function is\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\frac{\\lambda^x e^{-\\lambda}}{x!}.\n$$\n\nHere $\\lambda=1.1$, so\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\frac{1.1^x e^{-1.1}}{x!}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nP(X=3)&=f(3)\\\\\n&=\\frac{1.1^3e^{-1.1}}{3!}\\\\\n&\\approx 0.0738425664.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nRounded to four decimal places, the answer is $0.0738$." :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-e0acaaa5-2cd5-585e-9e7b-5ecd5fab47c9"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]}]
